2026-10-09T22:34:19.9011103Z [36;1m# As noted above defaults are awkward to handle as GitHub Actions will inject those values as the input[0m
2026-10-09T22:34:19.9011797Z [36;1m# if the caller doesn't provide them, thus if the input matches the default we don't set it as we[0m
